## Why This Is Asked
Tests CKNE-aware scheduling for ML inference in a multi-tenant GPU cluster, focusing on real-time dynamics, SLA guarantees, and fairness.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE to per-tenant resource mapping (concurrency, batch, memory)
- minute-by-minute rebalancing with SLA guarantees
- per-tenant quotas and fairness under traffic spikes

## Code Example
```javascript
function mapCKNE(ckne){
  const concurrency = Math.max(1, Math.min(8, Math.round(2 + ckne * 6)));
  const batch = Math.max(1, Math.min(128, Math.round(16 + ckne * 112)));
  const memMB = Math.round(256 + ckne * 1024);
  return {concurrency, batch, memMB};
}
```

